{"id":"n31702-2-4","stage":2,"title":"절대 · 绝对","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31702-2-4-1","ko":"어떻게 밀린 방학 숙제를 오늘 하루에 다 할 수 있겠어?","zh":"怎么可能今天一天就能做完积压的假期作业啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀린","meaning":"积压，堆积，拖欠","explanation":"밀리다：积压，堆积，拖欠；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"밀리다","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15786","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숙제를","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하루에","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"13748c44ad5107b0","term":"밀리다","zh":"积压，堆积，拖欠","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3","entryId":"15786","definition":"无法处理的事情或东西被堆积起来。","pronunciation":["밀리다"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"b33db886cc66d392","term":"숙제","zh":"作业","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3","entryId":"65226","definition":"为了复习或预习，给学生布置的课后功课。","pronunciation":["숙쩨"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f92d7e785077cd6504e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31702-2-4-2","ko":"절대 못 하지.","zh":"绝对做不完的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"절대","meaning":"绝对，绝","explanation":"절대：绝对，绝","readings":[{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31702","senseId":"2","lemma":"절대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0a8790a2dbe122f3","term":"절대","zh":"绝对，绝","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3","entryId":"31702","definition":"不管在什么情况下都必须。","pronunciation":["절때"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a8b8d8b907a4d61249d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31702","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3291,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["绝对做不完的。","我昨天借出去的笔记本，你放在哪儿了？","怎么可能今天一天就能做完积压的假期作业啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["绝对做不完的。","怎么可能今天一天就能做完积压的假期作业啊？","我昨天借出去的笔记本，你放在哪儿了？"],"answer":0}]}
